## Practice task (component type: JOIN)

Previous insurance claim assessments are A/input 0, revised assessments B/input 1, for an insurer operating across the Gulf Cooperation Council states. Approved payouts are expressed in the insurer’s reporting currency, UAE dirhams (AED).

Unique claim_number keys are sorted ascending and Join key is $claim_number=$claim_number. All three outputs are wired: 0=A-only, 1=both, 2=B-only.

Write CTL2 JOIN logic that classifies every matched claim using the payout difference: B.approved_payout_aed minus A.approved_payout_aed.

- A difference of at least AED 1,000 is MATERIAL_INCREASE.
- A difference of at most AED -1,000 is MATERIAL_DECREASE.
- A difference of exactly zero is UNCHANGED.
- Any other difference is MINOR_ADJUSTMENT.

Keep every matched row and populate assessment_change with its classification. Payouts are nonnegative and non-null.

A metadata:
| Field | Type | Nullable |
|---|---|---|
| claim_number | long | no |
| approved_payout_aed | decimal | no |

B metadata:
| Field | Type | Nullable |
|---|---|---|
| claim_number | long | no |
| approved_payout_aed | decimal | no |

Matched output metadata:
| Field | Type | Nullable |
|---|---|---|
| claim_number | long | no |
| assessment_change | string | no |

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    decimal difference = $in.1.approved_payout_aed - $in.0.approved_payout_aed;
    $out.0.claim_number = $in.0.claim_number;
    if (difference >= 1000D) {
        $out.1.assessment_change = "MATERIAL_INCREASE";
    } else if (difference <= -1000D) {
        $out.0.assessment_change = "MATERIAL_DECREASE";
    } else if (difference == 0D) {
        $out.0.assessment_change = "UNCHANGED";
    } else {
        $out.0.assessment_change = "MINOR_ADJUSTMENT";
    }
    return ALL;
}
```

